title: "Mapping the Spatial Sensitivity of East Java Landscapes to El Niño (2001–2025): A 25-Year Multi-Sensor Earth Observation Pipeline and Policy Translation Framework"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
url: "https://github.com/mkrifai/east-java-elnino-sensitivity"
