abstract: "A 25-year multi-sensor satellite observation pipeline (2001–2025) in Google Earth Engine mapping the terrestrial sensitivity of East Java landscapes to El Niño across a 1 km grid, producing four operational deliverables: Climate Response Atlas, Landscape Sensitivity Atlas, Agricultural Sensitivity Atlas, and Policy Translation Decision-Support Framework."
